if(typeof require==='function'){var Classy=require('./classy');var Box2D=require('./box2d');var CollectibleState=require('./collectiblestate');var Log=require('./log');}var Collectible=Classy.newClass().name('Collectible');Collectible.fields({id:null,type:0,x:0,y:0,rotation:0,b2dbody:null,log:null});Collectible.constructor(function(collectibleState){this.setCollectibleState(collectibleState);this.log=Log.create('Collectible '+this.id);});Collectible.methods({getId:function(){return this.id;},getType:function(){return this.type;},setX:function(x){this.x=x;},getX:function(){return this.x;},setY:function(y){this.y=y;},getY:function(){return this.y;},setRotation:function(rotation){this.rotation=rotation;},getRotation:function(){return this.rotation;},setB2DBody:function(b2dbody){this.b2dbody=b2dbody;},getB2DBody:function(){return this.b2dbody;},setCollectibleState:function(collectibleState){this.id=collectibleState.getId();this.x=collectibleState.getX();this.y=collectibleState.getY();this.rotation=collectibleState.getRotation();this.type=collectibleState.getType();if(this.b2dbody){this.b2dbody.SetPositionAndAngle(Box2D.Common.Math.b2Vec2.Make(this.x,this.y),this.rotation);}},getCollectibleState:function(){var cs=CollectibleState.withState(this.id,this.type,this.x,this.y,this.rotation);return cs;},update:function(deltaTime){this.x=this.b2dbody.GetPosition().x;this.y=this.b2dbody.GetPosition().y;this.rotation=this.b2dbody.GetAngle();}});if(typeof module==='object'){module.exports=Collectible;}